  },
  {
    "id": "4",
    "english": "Have a slope not greater than 8 %, overcome a level difference not greater than 0.4 m and have a horizontal projection not greater than 5 m",
    "note": "The same judgment calls as item 3: there is no explicit modal (the infinitive 'Ter' depends on an unseen lead-in), and the renderings of 'inclinação' (slope), 'vencer' (overcome), 'desnível' (level difference) and 'projecção horizontal' (horizontal projection) are the same. 'não superior a' = 'not greater than' (at most). The source's 0,4 is written 0.4."
  }
]

